WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:04.570
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:04.570 --> 00:08.200
Omoi wa kouya o yuku

00:08.200 --> 00:16.130
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

00:21.280 --> 00:27.790
Yaketsuku hizashi no moto kimi wa nani omou?

00:27.790 --> 00:33.730
Urei no hitomi wa ima nani o utsusu?

00:33.730 --> 00:42.670
Mayowazu ni irareru no nara
step by step tayasui darou

00:42.670 --> 00:47.440
Kaze no you ni

00:47.440 --> 00:50.510
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:50.510 --> 00:54.120
Akatsuki no kouya o yuku

00:54.120 --> 01:00.560
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

01:00.560 --> 01:07.360
Don't be afraid kawaru koto wa
osoreru koto ja nai

01:07.360 --> 01:13.470
Kimi ga kimi de aru naraba will be with you

01:13.470 --> 01:20.210
Odayaka na hi o yume-mite

01:20.210 --> 01:27.440
Michi-naki tabiji wa tsuzuku

01:43.400 --> 01:48.600
Man tends to fear and yearn for any
power that he does not understand.

01:48.600 --> 01:54.210
This is a facility that was once built
to monitor the witches' village.

01:54.210 --> 01:57.310
So, you're... Rosenberg.

01:57.310 --> 02:03.280
Ellis, you have continued to travel
in search of the truth, have you not?

02:03.280 --> 02:08.590
You wish to know if it was you
who killed Dr. Schneider...

02:08.590 --> 02:12.730
There is only one person in
the world who knows the answer.

02:12.730 --> 02:14.500
And that person is me.

02:14.500 --> 02:17.730
Tell me. Tell me the truth.

02:17.730 --> 02:19.730
The answer...

02:19.730 --> 02:21.570
...is this.

02:39.220 --> 02:41.520
Ellis...

02:41.520 --> 02:43.660
Artificial life forms...

02:43.660 --> 02:47.250
...react in extreme ways to
fragments of their memory.

02:50.900 --> 02:53.900
You two have a truly close relationship.

02:53.900 --> 02:59.770
As someone who has watched over
you two, it brings me great joy.

02:59.770 --> 03:01.580
Watched over us?

03:01.580 --> 03:08.850
In truth, I am the one who
orchestrated this journey of yours.

03:08.850 --> 03:10.690
What do you mean?

03:10.690 --> 03:13.520
If I set Ellis loose with her memory gone,

03:13.520 --> 03:16.820
and created a critical situation
by putting a bounty on her head,

03:16.820 --> 03:18.890
it was simple enough to deduce

03:18.890 --> 03:23.300
that the descendants of the witches
would assign an escort for her.

03:23.300 --> 03:26.730
And the bounty hunter who
just happened to be chosen...

03:26.730 --> 03:29.830
...was you, Nadie.

03:31.510 --> 03:35.740
In time, a friendship would
blossom between the two.

03:35.740 --> 03:39.550
That part also turned out
just as I had anticipated.

03:39.550 --> 03:42.420
So you're saying this is
something that you orchestrated?

03:42.420 --> 03:44.750
That is not all.

03:44.750 --> 03:47.720
I am also the one who prepared that boy

03:47.720 --> 03:50.990
in order to bring your hearts together as one.

03:54.860 --> 04:01.700
Ellis... So that's your name...

04:01.700 --> 04:07.310
Open your eyes... my Ellis...

04:07.310 --> 04:09.510
I don't get it at all...

04:09.510 --> 04:11.910
Why go to such lengths?

04:11.910 --> 04:15.620
What is it that you want to accomplish?
What's your objective?

04:15.620 --> 04:18.720
A witch's powers.

04:18.720 --> 04:25.290
It was all to awaken the
witch's powers locked within Ellis.

04:25.290 --> 04:28.030
In order to awaken the witch's powers,

04:28.030 --> 04:30.300
Ellis must be driven to the brink,

04:30.300 --> 04:34.000
and when her powers have
been enhanced by her emotions,

04:34.000 --> 04:39.770
the person she cherishes most
must ultimately be taken away...

04:41.310 --> 04:45.450
That is right, Nadie. I am talking about you.

04:45.450 --> 04:49.420
You were prepared for Ellis's awakening...

04:49.420 --> 04:52.390
...as a sacrifice.

04:52.390 --> 04:54.320
That's enough.

04:57.660 --> 04:59.420
Well, well.

05:01.760 --> 05:05.370
I am also the one who hired him.

05:05.370 --> 05:10.340
Though, about all I asked him
to do was to monitor you two

05:10.340 --> 05:14.510
and to retrieve L.A.
when he went out of control.

05:14.510 --> 05:17.950
I believe this is our first time to
actually meet and speak in person.

05:17.950 --> 05:19.080
Normally, we communicate by phone...

05:19.080 --> 05:23.380
You're the one who unilaterally
scrapped our contract.

05:23.380 --> 05:26.090
Put down your gun.

05:26.090 --> 05:28.090
Very well.

05:28.090 --> 05:32.460
I can wait until we get to
the witches' village to kill you

05:32.460 --> 05:35.360
and it will still not be too late.

05:35.360 --> 05:37.530
How naive of you.

05:37.530 --> 05:40.370
I don't recall saying I'd let you live.

05:42.000 --> 05:44.340
This isn't a job.

05:44.340 --> 05:47.540
I made up my mind that
I would protect these two.

05:47.540 --> 05:49.910
Is that so?

05:49.910 --> 05:52.750
Let's have drinks in Hell, amigo.

05:52.750 --> 05:54.440
Don't shoot him!

05:55.820 --> 05:57.450
Why are you stopping me?

05:57.450 --> 06:00.850
Because we still... don't have the answer.

06:03.460 --> 06:07.430
You are more intelligent than I expected.

06:07.430 --> 06:11.730
Then, let us meet at the witches' village.

06:31.890 --> 06:33.850
You two...

06:45.170 --> 06:47.030
Awake?

06:48.970 --> 06:50.840
Are you okay?

06:50.840 --> 06:52.600
I'm okay.

06:57.180 --> 06:59.440
Where were you?

07:01.180 --> 07:04.790
I've obtained some new
information regarding Rosenberg.

07:04.790 --> 07:07.590
He showed up earlier.

07:07.590 --> 07:10.960
He was a really nasty guy!

07:10.960 --> 07:14.520
I see, so he's making his move.

07:24.110 --> 07:25.770
Who's there?

07:32.950 --> 07:37.010
Rosen... berg...

07:41.060 --> 07:43.190
I have come for you.

07:43.190 --> 07:46.190
I...

07:46.190 --> 07:48.630
...despise you!

07:50.630 --> 07:54.190
I'll demolish you!

08:00.680 --> 08:03.980
Wh-What? Why?

08:03.980 --> 08:07.080
Just like how man
prostrates himself before God,

08:07.080 --> 08:10.780
you, too, are incapable of defying me.

08:14.520 --> 08:16.660
Stay away...

08:16.660 --> 08:18.790
Stay away. Stay away.

08:18.790 --> 08:22.030
Stay away from me!

08:22.030 --> 08:23.700
Get out!

08:23.700 --> 08:28.800
Get out... from inside me!

08:28.800 --> 08:31.270
There is no reason for you to suffer.

08:31.270 --> 08:33.840
After all, even your feelings for Ellis...

08:33.840 --> 08:37.710
...are ultimately nothing more
than a quality I gave to you.

08:37.710 --> 08:39.850
You're... lying...

08:39.850 --> 08:45.620
I... love... Ellis.

08:51.590 --> 08:55.730
Even that love is something I gave to you.

08:55.730 --> 08:58.760
You're... lying...

09:01.200 --> 09:05.000
Now, cast aside your emotions.

09:15.250 --> 09:19.620
"Maxwell's demon" was a theory
proposed in the 19th century

09:19.620 --> 09:21.860
and Rosenberg's father put
considerable effort into his research

09:21.860 --> 09:23.860
in order to make it real.

09:23.860 --> 09:27.030
And thus, he arrived at the "witch's powers."

09:27.030 --> 09:30.160
What's Maxwell's demon?

09:30.160 --> 09:33.170
- You want to know?
- Of course.

09:33.170 --> 09:36.170
Maxwell's demon is the
name of a theoretical model

09:36.170 --> 09:40.140
that was created in order
to halt the increase of entropy.

09:40.140 --> 09:41.810
Entropy basically refers to how

09:41.810 --> 09:43.780
the movement of molecules
excites surrounding molecules,

09:43.780 --> 09:46.650
causing them to begin moving as well.

09:46.650 --> 09:49.150
By assuming a demon with the power

09:49.150 --> 09:53.050
to stop the movement of molecules
from becoming uniform,

09:53.050 --> 09:54.290
an exchange of energy

09:54.290 --> 09:56.950
that completely negates the
second law of thermodynamics...

09:58.090 --> 09:59.360
Do you still want to hear more?

09:59.360 --> 10:02.060
Explain it so I can understand.

10:02.060 --> 10:05.300
There is a theory called Maxwell's demon.

10:05.300 --> 10:07.300
If this theory could be practically implemented,

10:07.300 --> 10:11.310
a great deal of power could
be produced without limit.

10:11.310 --> 10:13.910
- That is all.
- Are you mocking me?!

10:13.910 --> 10:16.940
Then shall I explain it to you again?

10:16.940 --> 10:18.810
Continue.

10:18.810 --> 10:24.020
In order to prove his hypothesis,
Rosenberg's father took his family

10:24.020 --> 10:28.980
and sought asylum from
Berlin under the old regime.

10:31.390 --> 10:36.230
When the Federal Government
obtained witch DNA,

10:36.230 --> 10:39.700
that hypothesis was approved
as a government project.

10:39.700 --> 10:46.240
But Rosenberg's father was
cut from the project's team.

10:46.240 --> 10:49.840
- Why?
- That's the government.

10:49.840 --> 10:54.850
The Feds took all his research away from him.

10:54.850 --> 10:57.840
In despair, Rosenberg's father...

11:13.170 --> 11:15.270
The Feds drove his father to his death

11:15.270 --> 11:19.270
and Rosenberg is most likely...

11:19.270 --> 11:21.280
...plotting revenge.

11:21.280 --> 11:25.710
And he came up with the idea
of obtaining Ellis's powers to do it.

11:25.710 --> 11:28.320
- Most likely.
- You've got to be kidding me!

11:28.320 --> 11:31.420
Like hell I'm letting him use
Ellis for something like that!

11:31.420 --> 11:33.420
I have to go.

11:33.420 --> 11:37.830
Because he has the answer.

11:37.830 --> 11:39.320
Ellis...

11:49.040 --> 11:51.700
It looks very good on you.

12:00.280 --> 12:02.340
I have a job for you.

12:12.230 --> 12:17.060
Please dispose of that man.

12:32.450 --> 12:34.920
Kiddies sure go to sleep early.

12:34.920 --> 12:36.820
I'm a little sleepy, too.

12:36.820 --> 12:40.480
- I guess you're a kiddy, too.
- Then I'm not sleepy.

12:43.790 --> 12:46.090
Are we sure about this information?

12:46.090 --> 12:47.900
There is no doubt.

12:47.900 --> 12:51.230
L.A. is completely under his control.

12:51.230 --> 12:55.040
It appears that his attachment
to Ellis has been erased.

12:55.040 --> 12:59.370
An artificial life form
without an ounce of emotion,

12:59.370 --> 13:01.110
who does Rosenberg's bidding.

13:01.110 --> 13:04.080
He is truly a killing machine.

13:04.080 --> 13:07.550
And he's coming after me?

13:07.550 --> 13:10.020
What do you plan to do?

13:10.020 --> 13:12.120
Look after Lirio for me.

13:12.120 --> 13:13.550
Wait.

13:13.550 --> 13:15.120
I'll come, too.

13:15.120 --> 13:17.390
You'll be in the way.

13:17.390 --> 13:19.290
I'm not listening.

13:19.290 --> 13:23.160
I'm the one he's after.

13:23.160 --> 13:26.430
That doesn't mean you have to go by yourself.

13:28.270 --> 13:30.840
If something were to happen to you,

13:30.840 --> 13:32.940
who would protect Ellis?

13:32.940 --> 13:37.340
But... letting you risk
yourself alone just seems...

13:41.280 --> 13:44.150
- Pay me.
- What?

13:44.150 --> 13:46.890
Hire me.

13:46.890 --> 13:51.890
I'm not doing it for you guys.
I'm doing it for the reward.

13:51.890 --> 13:53.950
So greedy.

13:55.330 --> 13:58.260
Ouch! This is all I've got.

14:02.300 --> 14:04.330
Keep the change.

14:14.850 --> 14:17.050
You better come back.

14:17.050 --> 14:19.250
Lirio will be waiting for you.

14:19.250 --> 14:21.080
I know.

14:27.060 --> 14:30.520
I'll... be waiting, too.

15:26.220 --> 15:27.980
Ricardo...

15:59.350 --> 16:01.340
Finally out of ammo, huh?

16:14.170 --> 16:17.070
This... is...

16:17.070 --> 16:19.440
...mine...

16:19.440 --> 16:25.550
Something... precious... of mine...

16:25.550 --> 16:29.180
It's... disappearing...

16:29.180 --> 16:34.090
No... this isn't it...

16:34.090 --> 16:37.650
What's truly... precious is...

17:05.490 --> 17:08.020
Where am I?

17:08.020 --> 17:11.290
What am I doing in this place?

17:13.230 --> 17:14.760
I have to go.

17:14.760 --> 17:17.770
I have to go to Ellis.

17:17.770 --> 17:19.630
Ellis...

17:19.630 --> 17:22.430
I'm coming, Ellis.

17:41.560 --> 17:45.730
- And you are?
- I'm not letting you go to Ellis.

17:45.730 --> 17:48.520
Anyone who gets in my way, I'll...

17:50.600 --> 17:52.330
...kill.

17:53.670 --> 17:55.660
That's how it should be.

17:57.200 --> 17:59.470
We'll call you when we find her.

17:59.470 --> 18:01.540
I should... go, too...

18:01.540 --> 18:04.170
You two stay here.

18:06.180 --> 18:07.780
Where are you?

18:07.780 --> 18:09.840
Where the hell are you?!

18:23.400 --> 18:25.670
Where are you?! Where are you?!

18:25.670 --> 18:26.830
Where are you?!

18:26.830 --> 18:28.870
Where the hell are you?!

18:28.870 --> 18:31.500
Where are you?! Where are you?!

18:35.510 --> 18:38.650
Nadie...

18:38.650 --> 18:41.480
Where are you?! Where are you?!
Where are you?! Where are you?!

18:45.720 --> 18:47.450
There you are!

18:54.190 --> 18:57.290
Let's have drinks in Hell, amigo!

19:16.820 --> 19:20.190
Oh... Ellis...

19:20.190 --> 19:22.750
So you came for me...

19:29.330 --> 19:32.470
I finally figured it out...

19:32.470 --> 19:37.460
The reason why I fell in love with you...

19:40.340 --> 19:45.180
It wasn't that man who
gave me the capacity to feel...

19:47.550 --> 19:49.380
It was you.

19:53.520 --> 19:58.490
Oh... Elli...

19:58.490 --> 20:01.330
Ellis...

20:01.330 --> 20:03.920
To me, you're...

20:05.930 --> 20:07.920
...everything...

20:09.800 --> 20:15.280
Oh, I'm starting to feel sleepy...

20:15.280 --> 20:19.850
Ellis... Ellis...

20:19.850 --> 20:23.550
Let me see a smile.

20:23.550 --> 20:28.490
I want to see you... smile...

20:31.430 --> 20:38.330
You're wonderful... my... Elli...

20:47.710 --> 20:49.470
Lirio.

21:11.400 --> 21:14.530
Thank goodness. So they're both all right?

21:14.530 --> 21:18.570
Yes. He has completed his job.

21:18.570 --> 21:20.910
Then, L.A. is...

21:20.910 --> 21:22.640
Dead.

21:27.310 --> 21:32.620
Oh, uh... Why do you suppose
Lirio went looking for Ricardo?

21:32.620 --> 21:35.960
She used to wait patiently in the past.

21:35.960 --> 21:40.330
Perhaps she's the same as me.

21:44.060 --> 21:50.370
As she watched over you two,
something must have changed.

21:50.370 --> 21:52.840
We'll come back right away. Wait until we...

21:56.680 --> 21:59.050
We began this journey
just the two of us, after all.

21:59.050 --> 22:04.350
Let's go without them from here on out, Ellis.

22:06.020 --> 22:09.760
Yessir, Nadie.

22:09.760 --> 22:11.060
All right.

22:11.060 --> 22:12.790
Let's go.

22:36.550 --> 22:40.350
Owaranai natsu no you ni

22:40.350 --> 22:43.790
Chiranai hana no you ni

22:43.790 --> 22:47.690
Dakishimeta sono ude o

22:47.690 --> 22:55.830
Zutto hanasanaide ite yo

23:02.040 --> 23:05.650
Sugari-tsuite-mitemo

23:05.650 --> 23:11.450
Mune wa mada chigau hakanasa de

23:11.450 --> 23:15.420
Toki no rizumu kazoeteru

23:15.420 --> 23:19.530
Akai hoshi no yoru

23:19.530 --> 23:23.530
Kiete-yuku nukumori

23:23.530 --> 23:27.470
Tsunagi-tometai no yo

23:27.470 --> 23:33.870
Hitomi tojita kimi o

23:33.870 --> 23:37.840
Akogare o kuri-kaeshi

23:37.840 --> 23:41.180
Doko e mo yukenaku-temo

23:41.180 --> 23:45.420
Setsunasa no tachidomaru

23:45.420 --> 23:51.730
Kono hito-toki ga futari no

23:51.730 --> 23:56.720
Subete yo
